  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through REDUCED INEQUALITIES in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDUCED INEQUALITIES will empower youth with particular emphasis on young women to secure financial stability through trainings on saving and investment and business development. Knowledge and skills acquired will enable youth to initiate business ventures thereby responding to high unemployment rates in South Sudan.  Youth use knowledge the to challenge traditional attitudes preventing young women&#x2019;s education and challenge political structures to improve management of natural resources.</narrative>
  </description>
